Package: lab09-pkgtools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Tools for Debian package version comparison and auditing
 This package provides two command-line utilities.
 .
 The vercmp utility compares Debian package versions using dpkg
 version ordering rules.
 .
 The pkgaudit utility analyses installed packages, dependencies,
 reverse usage, package leaves and package snapshots.
